^YTT(601.712,11,1,99,0)=" religion, possible injury from an unsuccessful attempt, etc."", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,11,1,100,0)="     {""id"": ""c650"", ""text"": ""2. I am not or only a little concerned about killing myself because of family,"
^YTT(601.712,11,1,101,0)=" friends, religion, possible injury from an unsuccessful attempt, etc."", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,11,1,102,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,11,1,103,0)="   {""id"": ""q439"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,11,1,104,0)="    ""text"": ""11. Select the one statement in each group that BEST describes how you have been"
^YTT(601.712,11,1,105,0)=" feeling for the PAST WEEK, INCLUDING TODAY."", "
^YTT(601.712,11,1,106,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,11,1,107,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,11,1,108,0)="     {""id"": ""c651"", ""text"": ""0. My reasons for wanting to commit suicide are primarily aimed at influencing"
^YTT(601.712,11,1,109,0)=" other people, such as getting even with people, making people pay attention to"
^YTT(601.712,11,1,110,0)=" me, etc."", ""quickKey"": 0}, "
^YTT(601.712,11,1,111,0)="     {""id"": ""c652"", ""text"": ""1. My reasons for wanting to commit suicide are not only aimed at influencing"
^YTT(601.712,11,1,112,0)=" other people, but also represent a way of solving my problems."", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
