^YTT(601.712,16,1,488,0)="    ""text"": ""60. I'm very erratic, changing my feelings all the time."", "
^YTT(601.712,16,1,489,0)="    ""intro"": ""Please read each item carefully and answer each question as it pertains to you."", "
