^YTT(601.712,17,1,288,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,289,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,290,0)="   {""id"": ""q1423"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,291,0)="    ""text"": ""38. I do what I want without worrying about its effect on others."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,292,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,293,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,294,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,295,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,296,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,297,0)="   {""id"": ""q1424"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,298,0)="    ""text"": ""39. Taking so-called illegal drugs may be unwise, but in the past I found I"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,299,0)=" needed them."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,300,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,301,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,302,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,303,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,304,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,305,0)="   {""id"": ""q1425"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,306,0)="    ""text"": ""40. I guess I'm a fearful and inhibited person."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,307,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,308,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,309,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,310,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,311,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,312,0)="   {""id"": ""q1426"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,313,0)="    ""text"": ""41. I've done a number of stupid things on impulse that ended up causing me great"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,314,0)=" trouble."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,315,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,316,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,317,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,318,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,319,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,320,0)="   {""id"": ""q1427"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,321,0)="    ""text"": ""42. I never forgive an insult or forget an embarrassment that someone caused me."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,322,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,323,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,324,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,325,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,326,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,327,0)="   {""id"": ""q1428"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,328,0)="    ""text"": ""43. I often feel sad or tense right after something good has happened to me."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,329,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,330,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,331,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,332,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,333,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,334,0)="   {""id"": ""q1429"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,335,0)="    ""text"": ""44. I feel terribly depressed and sad much of the time now."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,336,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,337,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,338,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,339,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,340,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,341,0)="   {""id"": ""q1430"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,342,0)="    ""text"": ""45. I always try hard to please others, even when I dislike them."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,343,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,344,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,345,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,346,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,347,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,348,0)="   {""id"": ""q1431"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,349,0)="    ""text"": ""46. I've always had less interest in sex than most people do."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,350,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,351,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,352,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,353,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,354,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,355,0)="   {""id"": ""q1432"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,356,0)="    ""text"": ""47. I tend to always blame myself when things go wrong."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,357,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,358,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,359,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,360,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,361,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,362,0)="   {""id"": ""q1433"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,363,0)="    ""text"": ""48. A long time ago, I decided it's best to have little to do with people."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,364,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,365,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,366,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,367,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,368,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,369,0)="   {""id"": ""q1434"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,370,0)="    ""text"": ""49. Since I was a child, I have always had to watch out for people who were"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,371,0)=" trying to cheat me."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,372,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,373,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,374,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,375,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,376,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,377,0)="   {""id"": ""q1435"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,378,0)="    ""text"": ""50. I strongly resent \u0022big shots  who always think they can do better than I"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,379,0)=" can."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,380,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,381,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,382,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,383,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,384,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,385,0)="   {""id"": ""q1436"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,386,0)="    ""text"": ""51. When things get boring, I like to stir up some excitement."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,387,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,388,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,389,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,390,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,391,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,392,0)="   {""id"": ""q1437"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,393,0)="    ""text"": ""52. I have an alcohol problem that has made difficulties for me and my family."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,394,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,395,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,396,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,397,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,398,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,399,0)="   {""id"": ""q1438"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,400,0)="    ""text"": ""53. Punishment never stopped me from doing what I wanted."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,401,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,402,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,403,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,404,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,405,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,406,0)="   {""id"": ""q1439"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,407,0)="    ""text"": ""54. There are many times, when for no reason, I feel very cheerful and full of"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,408,0)=" excitement."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,409,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,410,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,411,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,412,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,413,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,414,0)="   {""id"": ""q1440"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,415,0)="    ""text"": ""55. In recent weeks I feel worn out for no special reason."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,416,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,417,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,418,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,419,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,420,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,421,0)="   {""id"": ""q1441"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,422,0)="    ""text"": ""56. For some time now I've been feeling very guilty because I can't do things"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,423,0)=" right anymore."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,424,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,425,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,426,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,427,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,428,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,429,0)="   {""id"": ""q1442"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,430,0)="    ""text"": ""57. I think I am a very sociable and outgoing person."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,431,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,432,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,433,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,434,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,435,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,436,0)="   {""id"": ""q1443"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,437,0)="    ""text"": ""58. I've become very jumpy in the last few weeks."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,438,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,439,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,440,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,441,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,442,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,443,0)="   {""id"": ""q1444"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,444,0)="    ""text"": ""59. I keep very close track of my money so I am prepared if a need comes up."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,445,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,446,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,447,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,448,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,449,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,450,0)="   {""id"": ""q1445"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,451,0)="    ""text"": ""60. I just haven't had the luck in life that others have had."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,452,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,453,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,454,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,455,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,456,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,457,0)="   {""id"": ""q1446"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,458,0)="    ""text"": ""61. Ideas keep turning over and over in my mind and they won't go away."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,459,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,460,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,461,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,462,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,463,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,464,0)="   {""id"": ""q1447"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,465,0)="    ""text"": ""62. I've become quite discouraged and sad about my life in the past year or two."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,466,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,467,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,468,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,469,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,470,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,471,0)="   {""id"": ""q1448"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,472,0)="    ""text"": ""63. Many people have been spying into my private life for years."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,473,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,474,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,475,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,476,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,477,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,478,0)="   {""id"": ""q1449"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,479,0)="    ""text"": ""64. I don't know why, but sometimes I say cruel things just to make others"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,480,0)=" unhappy."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,481,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,482,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,483,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,484,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,485,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,486,0)="   {""id"": ""q1450"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,487,0)="    ""text"": ""65. I flew across the Atlantic thirty times last year."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,488,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,489,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,490,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,491,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,492,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,493,0)="   {""id"": ""q1451"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,494,0)="    ""text"": ""66. My habit of abusing drugs has caused me to miss work in the past."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,495,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,496,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,497,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,498,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,499,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,500,0)="   {""id"": ""q1452"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,501,0)="    ""text"": ""67. I have many ideas that are ahead of the times."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,502,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,503,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,504,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,505,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,506,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,507,0)="   {""id"": ""q1453"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,508,0)="    ""text"": ""68. Lately, I have to think things over and over again for no good reason."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,509,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,510,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,511,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,512,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,513,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,514,0)="   {""id"": ""q1454"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,515,0)="    ""text"": ""69. I avoid most social situations because I expect people to criticize or reject"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,516,0)=" me."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,517,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,518,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,519,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
