^YTT(601.712,17,1,736,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,737,0)="   {""id"": ""q1485"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,738,0)="    ""text"": ""100. I guess I'm no different from my parents in becoming somewhat of an"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,739,0)=" alcoholic."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,740,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,741,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,742,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,743,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,744,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,745,0)="   {""id"": ""q1486"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,746,0)="    ""text"": ""101. I guess I don't take many of my family responsibilities as seriously as I"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,747,0)=" should."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,748,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,749,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,750,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,751,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,752,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,753,0)="   {""id"": ""q1487"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,754,0)="    ""text"": ""102. Ever since I was a child, I have been losing touch with the real world."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,755,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,756,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,757,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,758,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,759,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,760,0)="   {""id"": ""q1488"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,761,0)="    ""text"": ""103. Sneaky people often try to get the credit for things I have done or thought"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,762,0)=" of."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,763,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,764,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,765,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,766,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,767,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,768,0)="   {""id"": ""q1489"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,769,0)="    ""text"": ""104. I can't experience much pleasure because I don't feel I deserve it."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,770,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,771,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,772,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,773,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,774,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,775,0)="   {""id"": ""q1490"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,776,0)="    ""text"": ""105. I have little desire for close friendships."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,777,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,778,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,779,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,780,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,781,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,782,0)="   {""id"": ""q1491"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,783,0)="    ""text"": ""106. I've had many periods in my life when I was so cheerful and used up so much"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,784,0)=" energy that I fell into a low mood."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,785,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,786,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,787,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,788,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,789,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,790,0)="   {""id"": ""q1492"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,791,0)="    ""text"": ""107. I have completely lost my appetite and have trouble sleeping most nights."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,792,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,793,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,794,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,795,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,796,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,797,0)="   {""id"": ""q1493"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,798,0)="    ""text"": ""108. I worry a great deal about being left alone and having to take care of"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,799,0)=" myself."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,800,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,801,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,802,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,803,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,804,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,805,0)="   {""id"": ""q1494"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,806,0)="    ""text"": ""109. The memory of a very upsetting experience in my past keeps coming back to"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,807,0)=" haunt my thoughts."", "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,808,0)="    "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,809,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,17,1,810,0)="     {""id"": ""c688"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,17,1,811,0)="     {""id"": ""c689"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,17,1,812,0)="   ]}, "
