^YTT(601.712,24,1,6,0)="    ""text"": ""A number of statements which people have used to describe themselves will be"
^YTT(601.712,24,1,7,0)=" given.  Read each statement and indicate how you feel Right now, that is, At"
^YTT(601.712,24,1,8,0)=" This Moment.  There are no right or wrong answers. Do not spend too much time on"
^YTT(601.712,24,1,9,0)=" any one statement, but give the answer which seems to describe your present"
^YTT(601.712,24,1,10,0)=" feelings best."""
