^YTT(601.712,49,1,170,0)="    ""text"": ""11. I am going to tell you a story. Please listen carefully because afterwards,"
^YTT(601.712,49,1,171,0)=" I'm going to ask you some questions about it.<br />"
^YTT(601.712,49,1,172,0)=" <br />Jill was a very successful stockbroker. She made a lot of money on the stock market."
^YTT(601.712,49,1,173,0)=" She then met Jack, a devastatingly handsome man. She married him and had three children."
^YTT(601.712,49,1,174,0)=" They lived in Chicago. She then stopped work and stayed at home to bring up her children."
^YTT(601.712,49,1,175,0)=" When they were teenagers, she went back to work. She and Jack lived happily ever after."""
^YTT(601.712,49,1,176,0)="    }, "
