^YTT(601.712,52,1,77,0)=" that specific question applies to you. You can click on the number with the"
^YTT(601.712,52,1,78,0)=" mouse or enter the number on the key board.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,52,1,79,0)="    ""columns"": 2, "
^YTT(601.712,52,1,80,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,52,1,81,0)="     {""id"": ""c241"", ""text"": ""1. Yes"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,52,1,82,0)="     {""id"": ""c237"", ""text"": ""2. No"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,52,1,83,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,52,1,84,0)="   {""id"": ""q5205"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,52,1,85,0)="    ""text"": ""A3. Since the time you developed a pain problem, how much has your pain changed"
^YTT(601.712,52,1,86,0)=" your ability to work?"", "
^YTT(601.712,52,1,87,0)="    ""intro"": ""In the following 20 questions, you will be asked to describe your pain and how it"
^YTT(601.712,52,1,88,0)=" affects your life. Under each question is a scale to record your answer. Read"
