^YTT(601.712,55,1,9,0)=" answer every question. If you are   unsure about how to answer, please give the"
^YTT(601.712,55,1,10,0)=" best answer you can. During the PAST WEEK, how much difficulty did you have. . ."
^YTT(601.712,55,1,11,0)="  """
