^YTT(601.712,69,1,6,0)="    ""text"": ""Understanding and communicating<br />This questionnaire asks about difficulties"
^YTT(601.712,69,1,7,0)=" due to health conditions. Health conditions include diseases or illnesses, other"
^YTT(601.712,69,1,8,0)=" health problems that may be short or long lasting, injuries, mental or emotional"
^YTT(601.712,69,1,9,0)=" problems, and problems with alcohol or drugs.<br />Think back over the past 30"
^YTT(601.712,69,1,10,0)=" days and answer these questions, thinking about how much difficulty you had"
^YTT(601.712,69,1,11,0)=" doing the following activities. In the past 30 days, how much DIFFICULTY did you"
^YTT(601.712,69,1,12,0)=" have in: """
