^YTT(601.712,72,1,6,0)="   {""id"": ""i760"", ""type"": ""IntroText"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,7,0)="    ""text"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,8,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,9,0)=" five questions.  """
^YTT(601.712,72,1,10,0)="    }, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,11,0)="   {""id"": ""q5997"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,12,0)="    ""text"": ""1). RATE PSYCHOLOGICAL PAIN (hurt, anguish, or misery in your mind, not stress,"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,13,0)=" not physical pain):"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,14,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,15,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,16,0)=" five questions.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,17,0)="    ""min"": 1, ""max"": 5, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,18,0)="    ""legend"":[""Low pain"", "" High pain""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,19,0)="   {""id"": ""q5998"", ""type"": ""StringQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,20,0)="    ""text"": ""1A). What I find most painful is:"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,21,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,22,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,23,0)=" five questions.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,24,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 520, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 0}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,25,0)="   {""id"": ""q5999"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,26,0)="    ""text"": ""1B). Rank of importance:"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,27,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,28,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,29,0)=" five questions.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,30,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 50, ""min"": 1, ""max"": 5}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,31,0)="   {""id"": ""q6000"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,32,0)="    ""text"": ""2). RATE STRESS (your general feeling of being pressured or overwhelmed):"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,33,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,34,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,35,0)=" five questions.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,36,0)="    ""min"": 1, ""max"": 5, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,37,0)="    ""legend"":[""Low stress"", ""High stress""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,38,0)="   {""id"": ""q6001"", ""type"": ""StringQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,39,0)="    ""text"": ""2A). What I find most stressful is:"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,40,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,41,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,42,0)=" five questions.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,43,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 520, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 0}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,44,0)="   {""id"": ""q6002"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,45,0)="    ""text"": ""2B). Rank of importance:"", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,46,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,47,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,48,0)=" five questions.  "", "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,49,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 50, ""min"": 1, ""max"": 5}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,50,0)="   {""id"": ""q6003"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,51,0)="    ""text"": ""3). RATE AGITATION (emotional urgency; feeling that you need to take action; not"
