^YTT(601.712,72,1,53,0)="    ""intro"": ""Rate and fill out each item according to how you feel right now. Then rank in"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,54,0)=" order of importance 1 to 5 (1 is most important, 5 is least important) the first"
^YTT(601.712,72,1,55,0)=" five questions.  "", "
