^YTT(601.712,72,1,116,0)="    ""legend"":[""Extremely low risk"", "" Extremely high risk""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,117,0)="   {""id"": ""q6013"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,72,1,118,0)="    ""text"": ""7). How much is being suicidal related to thoughts and feelings about yourself?"", "
