^YTT(601.712,74,1,59,0)=" should live, both now and in the future. This includes your goals in life, what"
^YTT(601.712,74,1,60,0)=" you think is right or wrong, and the purpose or meaning of life as you see it."""
^YTT(601.712,74,1,61,0)="    }, "
