^YTT(601.712,74,1,470,0)="   {""id"": ""i889"", ""type"": ""IntroText"", "
^YTT(601.712,74,1,471,0)="    ""text"": ""COMMUNITY is the whole city, town, or rural area where you live (it is not just"
^YTT(601.712,74,1,472,0)=" your neighborhood). COMMUNITY includes how nice the area looks, the amount of"
^YTT(601.712,74,1,473,0)=" crime, and how well you like the people. It also includes places to go for fun"
^YTT(601.712,74,1,474,0)=" like parks,concerts, sporting events, and restaurants. You may also consider the"
^YTT(601.712,74,1,475,0)=" cost of things you need to buy, the availability of jobs, the government, "
^YTT(601.712,74,1,476,0)=" schools, taxes, and pollution."""
^YTT(601.712,74,1,477,0)="    }, "
