^YTT(601.712,86,1,20,0)=" you have no feelings at all at the present moment, please answer according to"
^YTT(601.712,86,1,21,0)=" how you think you might have felt. Please answer honestly. All questions refer"
^YTT(601.712,86,1,22,0)=" to the last week. If you felt different ways at different times in the week,"
^YTT(601.712,86,1,23,0)=" give a rating for how things were for you on average. Please be sure to answer"
^YTT(601.712,86,1,24,0)=" each question."", "
