^YTT(601.712,91,1,113,0)="   {""id"": ""q7321"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,91,1,114,0)="    ""text"": ""11. VISUAL DISTURBANCES - Ask, \u0022Does the light appear to be too bright? Is"
