^YTT(601.712,103,1,6,0)="   {""id"": ""i2367"", ""type"": ""IntroText"","
^YTT(601.712,103,1,7,0)="    ""text"": ""<strong>Instructions:</strong> Below is a list of problems that people sometimes have in response"
^YTT(601.712,103,1,8,0)=" to a very stressful experience. Please read each problem and then select one of"
^YTT(601.712,103,1,9,0)=" the options to indicate how much you have been bothered by that problem <u>in the"
^YTT(601.712,103,1,10,0)=" past week</u>. The options include not at all, a little bit, moderately, quite a"
^YTT(601.712,103,1,11,0)=" bit, and extremely. <br /><br /><strong>In the past week, how much were you bothered by:</strong>"""
^YTT(601.712,103,1,12,0)="    },"
