^YTT(601.712,108,1,41,0)=" <br />  X  Yes, most of the time (This would mean: \u0022I have felt happy most"
^YTT(601.712,108,1,42,0)=" of the time\u0022 during the past week.) <br />     No, not very often <br />   "
^YTT(601.712,108,1,43,0)="  No, not at all  <br /> <br /> Please complete the other questions in the same"
