^YTT(601.712,112,1,4,0)=" ""printTitle"": ""WHYMPI Pain Interference Scale (MPI-PAIN-INTRF)"","
^YTT(601.712,112,1,5,0)=" ""content"":["
^YTT(601.712,112,1,6,0)="   {""id"": ""i2377"", ""type"": ""IntroText"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,7,0)="    ""text"": ""In the following 9 questions, you will be asked to describe your pain and how it"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,8,0)=" affects your life.  Under each question is a scale to record your answer.  Read"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,9,0)=" each question carefully and then select a number on the scale under that"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,10,0)=" question to indicate how that specific question applies to you. It is"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,11,0)=" recommended that you use the number keys on the keyboard to select the response"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,12,0)=" for each question."""
^YTT(601.712,112,1,13,0)="    }, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,14,0)="   {""id"": ""q7961"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,15,0)="    ""text"": ""1. In general, how much does your pain problem interfere with your day to day"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,16,0)=" activities?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,17,0)="    ""intro"": ""In the following 9 questions, you will be asked to describe your pain and how it"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,18,0)=" affects your life.  Under each question is a scale to record your answer.  Read"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,19,0)=" each question carefully and then select a number on the scale under that"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,20,0)=" question to indicate how that specific question applies to you. It is"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,21,0)=" recommended that you use the number keys on the keyboard to select the response"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,22,0)=" for each question."", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,23,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,24,0)="    ""legend"":[""No interference"", ""Extreme interference""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,25,0)="   {""id"": ""q7962"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": true, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,26,0)="    ""text"": ""2a. Are you retired from work for reasons other than your pain problem?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,27,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,28,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,112,1,29,0)="     {""id"": ""c3907"", ""text"": ""1. Yes"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,30,0)="     {""id"": ""c3908"", ""text"": ""2. No"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,31,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,32,0)="   {""id"": ""q7963"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,33,0)="    ""text"": ""2. Since the time you developed a pain problem, how much has your pain changed"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,34,0)=" your ability to work?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,35,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,36,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,37,0)="   {""id"": ""q7964"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,38,0)="    ""text"": ""3. How much has your pain changed the amount of satisfaction or enjoyment you get"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,39,0)=" from participating in social and recreational activities?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,40,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,41,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,42,0)="   {""id"": ""q7965"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,43,0)="    ""text"": ""4. How much has your pain changed your ability to participate in recreational and"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,44,0)=" other social activities?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,45,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,46,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,47,0)="   {""id"": ""q7966"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,48,0)="    ""text"": ""5. How much has your pain changed the amount of satisfaction you get from"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,49,0)=" family-related activities?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,50,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,51,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,52,0)="   {""id"": ""q7967"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,53,0)="    ""text"": ""6. How much has your pain changed your marriage and other family relationships?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,54,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,55,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,56,0)="   {""id"": ""q7968"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": true, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,57,0)="    ""text"": ""7a. Are you currently working?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,58,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,59,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,112,1,60,0)="     {""id"": ""c3907"", ""text"": ""1. Yes"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,61,0)="     {""id"": ""c3908"", ""text"": ""2. No"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,62,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,63,0)="   {""id"": ""q7969"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,64,0)="    ""text"": ""7. How much has your pain changed the amount of satisfaction or enjoyment you get"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,65,0)=" from work?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,66,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,67,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,68,0)="   {""id"": ""q7970"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,69,0)="    ""text"": ""8. How much has your pain changed your ability to do household chores?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,70,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,71,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,72,0)="   {""id"": ""q7971"", ""type"": ""SliderQuestion"", ""required"": true, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,73,0)="    ""text"": ""9. How much has your pain changed your friendships with people other than your"
^YTT(601.712,112,1,74,0)=" family?"", "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,75,0)="    ""min"": 0, ""max"": 6, "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,76,0)="    ""legend"":[""No change"", ""Extreme change""]}], "
^YTT(601.712,112,1,77,0)=" ""rules"":["
^YTT(601.712,112,1,78,0)="   {""question"": ""q7962"", ""operator"": ""EQ"", ""value"": ""c3907"", "
