^YTT(601.712,115,1,5,0)=" ""printTitle"": ""Millon Clinical Multiaxial Inventory-IV"","
^YTT(601.712,115,1,6,0)=" ""content"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,7,0)="   {""id"": ""i2381"", ""type"": ""IntroText"", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,8,0)="    ""text"": ""This inventory contains a list of statements that can be used to describe a"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,9,0)=" person's feelings and attitudes. Read each statement carefully and answer it as"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,10,0)=" truthfully as you can as the results of this inventory are designed to help you."
^YTT(601.712,115,1,11,0)=" Do not be concerned if a few of the statements seem unusual; they are included"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,12,0)=" to describe the feelings and attitudes of people with many types of problems.<br"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,13,0)=" /><br />If you agree with a statement or decide that it describes you, choose"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,14,0)=" \u0022True.\u0022 If you disagree with a statement or decide that it does not"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,15,0)=" describe you, choose \u0022False.\u0022 Try to answer every statement, even if"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,16,0)=" you are not sure of your choice. If you have tried your best and still cannot"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,17,0)=" decide, choose \u0022False.\u0022<br /><br />There is no time limit for"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,18,0)=" completing the inventory, but it is best to work as quickly as is comfortable"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,19,0)=" for you. """
^YTT(601.712,115,1,20,0)="    }, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,21,0)="   {""id"": ""q8015"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,22,0)="    ""text"": ""1. Lately, my strength seems to be draining out of me, even in the morning."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,23,0)="    ""intro"": ""This inventory contains a list of statements that can be used to describe a"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,24,0)=" person's feelings and attitudes. Read each statement carefully and answer it as"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,25,0)=" truthfully as you can as the results of this inventory are designed to help you."
^YTT(601.712,115,1,26,0)=" Do not be concerned if a few of the statements seem unusual; they are included"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,27,0)=" to describe the feelings and attitudes of people with many types of problems.<br"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,28,0)=" /><br />If you agree with a statement or decide that it describes you, choose"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,29,0)=" \u0022True.\u0022 If you disagree with a statement or decide that it does not"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,30,0)=" describe you, choose \u0022False.\u0022 Try to answer every statement, even if"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,31,0)=" you are not sure of your choice. If you have tried your best and still cannot"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,32,0)=" decide, choose \u0022False.\u0022<br /><br />There is no time limit for"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,33,0)=" completing the inventory, but it is best to work as quickly as is comfortable"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,34,0)=" for you. "", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,35,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,36,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,37,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,38,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,39,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,40,0)="   {""id"": ""q8016"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,41,0)="    ""text"": ""2. I always make sure that my work is well planned and organized."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,42,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,43,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,44,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,45,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,46,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,47,0)="   {""id"": ""q8017"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,48,0)="    ""text"": ""3. I enjoy doing so many different things that I can't make up my mind what to do"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,49,0)=" first."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,50,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,51,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,52,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,53,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,54,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,55,0)="   {""id"": ""q8018"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,56,0)="    ""text"": ""4. I'm concerned that people I depend on will leave me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,57,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,58,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,59,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,60,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,61,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,62,0)="   {""id"": ""q8019"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,63,0)="    ""text"": ""5. Although I'm afraid to make friendships, I wish I had more than I do."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,64,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,65,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,66,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,67,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,68,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,69,0)="   {""id"": ""q8020"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,70,0)="    ""text"": ""6. What few feelings I seem to have, I rarely show to the outside world."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,71,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,72,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,73,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,74,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,75,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,76,0)="   {""id"": ""q8021"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,77,0)="    ""text"": ""7. I have a hard time keeping my balance when walking."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,78,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,79,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,80,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,81,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,82,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,83,0)="   {""id"": ""q8022"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,84,0)="    ""text"": ""8. I'm always looking for opportunities that are exciting and new for me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,85,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,86,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,87,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,88,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,89,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,90,0)="   {""id"": ""q8023"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,91,0)="    ""text"": ""9. Sometimes I can be pretty rough and mean in my relations with my family."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,92,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,93,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,94,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,95,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,96,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,97,0)="   {""id"": ""q8024"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,98,0)="    ""text"": ""10. I like being the center of attention."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,99,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,100,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,101,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,102,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,103,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,104,0)="   {""id"": ""q8025"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,105,0)="    ""text"": ""11. As a teenager, I got into lots of trouble because of bad school behavior."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,106,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,107,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,108,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,109,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,110,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,111,0)="   {""id"": ""q8026"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,112,0)="    ""text"": ""12. I'm afraid to get really close to another person because it may end up with"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,113,0)=" my being ridiculed or shamed."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,114,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,115,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,116,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,117,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,118,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,119,0)="   {""id"": ""q8027"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,120,0)="    ""text"": ""13. I can tell that people are talking about me when I pass by them."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,121,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,122,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,123,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,124,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,125,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,126,0)="   {""id"": ""q8028"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,127,0)="    ""text"": ""14. I began to feel like a failure some years ago."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,128,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,129,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,130,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,131,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,132,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,133,0)="   {""id"": ""q8029"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,134,0)="    ""text"": ""15. When I have a choice, I prefer to do things alone."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,135,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,136,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,137,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,138,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,139,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,140,0)="   {""id"": ""q8030"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,141,0)="    ""text"": ""16. Lately, I have begun to feel like smashing things."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,142,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,143,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,144,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,145,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,146,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,147,0)="   {""id"": ""q8031"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,148,0)="    ""text"": ""17. Things that are going well today won't last very long."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,149,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,150,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,151,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,152,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,153,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,154,0)="   {""id"": ""q8032"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,155,0)="    ""text"": ""18. I sometimes feel crazy-like or unreal when things start to go badly in my"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,156,0)=" life."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,157,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,158,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,159,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,160,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,161,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,162,0)="   {""id"": ""q8033"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,163,0)="    ""text"": ""19. I do what I want without worrying about its effect on others."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,164,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,165,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,166,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,167,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,168,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,169,0)="   {""id"": ""q8034"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,170,0)="    ""text"": ""20. I approach my daily activities with lots of energy and persistence."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,171,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,172,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,173,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,174,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,175,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,176,0)="   {""id"": ""q8035"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,177,0)="    ""text"": ""21. I never forgive an insult or forget an embarrassment someone has caused me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,178,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,179,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,180,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,181,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,182,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,183,0)="   {""id"": ""q8036"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,184,0)="    ""text"": ""22. I feel terribly depressed and sad much of the time now. "", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,185,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,186,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,187,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,188,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,189,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,190,0)="   {""id"": ""q8037"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,191,0)="    ""text"": ""23. I tend to always blame myself when things go wrong."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,192,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,193,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,194,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,195,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,196,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,197,0)="   {""id"": ""q8038"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,198,0)="    ""text"": ""24. A long time ago, I decided it's best to have little to do with people."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,199,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,200,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,201,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,202,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,203,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,204,0)="   {""id"": ""q8039"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,205,0)="    ""text"": ""25. I have an alcohol problem that has made difficulties for me and my family."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,206,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,207,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,208,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,209,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,210,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,211,0)="   {""id"": ""q8040"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,212,0)="    ""text"": ""26. I'm a very socially inhibited and shy person."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,213,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,214,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,215,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,216,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,217,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,218,0)="   {""id"": ""q8041"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,219,0)="    ""text"": ""27. There are many times when, for no reason, I feel very cheerful and full of"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,220,0)=" excitement."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,221,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,222,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,223,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,224,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,225,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,226,0)="   {""id"": ""q8042"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,227,0)="    ""text"": ""28. In recent weeks, I feel worn out for no special reason."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,228,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,229,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,230,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,231,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,232,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,233,0)="   {""id"": ""q8043"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,234,0)="    ""text"": ""29. My time is more valuable than others'."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,235,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,236,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,237,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,238,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,239,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,240,0)="   {""id"": ""q8044"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,241,0)="    ""text"": ""30. I am always looking to make new friends and meet new people."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,242,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,243,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,244,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,245,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,246,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,247,0)="   {""id"": ""q8045"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,248,0)="    ""text"": ""31. I've become very jumpy in the last few weeks."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,249,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,250,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,251,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,252,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,253,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,254,0)="   {""id"": ""q8046"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,255,0)="    ""text"": ""32. I just haven't had the luck in life that others have had."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,256,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,257,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,258,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,259,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,260,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,261,0)="   {""id"": ""q8047"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,262,0)="    ""text"": ""33. Ideas keep turning over and over in my mind and they won't go away."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,263,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,264,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,265,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,266,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,267,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,268,0)="   {""id"": ""q8048"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,269,0)="    ""text"": ""34. I've become quite discouraged and sad about life in the past year or two."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,270,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,271,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,272,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,273,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,274,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,275,0)="   {""id"": ""q8049"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,276,0)="    ""text"": ""35. I try to make everything I do as perfect as possible."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,277,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,278,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,279,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,280,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,281,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,282,0)="   {""id"": ""q8050"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,283,0)="    ""text"": ""36. My habit of abusing drugs has caused me to miss work in the past."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,284,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,285,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,286,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,287,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,288,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,289,0)="   {""id"": ""q8051"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,290,0)="    ""text"": ""37. My moods seem to change a great deal from one day to the next."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,291,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,292,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,293,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,294,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,295,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,296,0)="   {""id"": ""q8052"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,297,0)="    ""text"": ""38. I use my charm to get my way."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,298,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,299,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,300,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,301,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,302,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,303,0)="   {""id"": ""q8053"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,304,0)="    ""text"": ""39. I often think that I don't deserve the good things that happen to me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,305,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,306,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,307,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,308,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,309,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,310,0)="   {""id"": ""q8054"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,311,0)="    ""text"": ""40. I have cut or hurt myself in the past on purpose."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,312,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,313,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,314,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,315,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,316,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,317,0)="   {""id"": ""q8055"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,318,0)="    ""text"": ""41. I can't seem to sleep, and wake just as tired as when I went to bed."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,319,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,320,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,321,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,322,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,323,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,324,0)="   {""id"": ""q8056"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,325,0)="    ""text"": ""42. I often let others make important decisions for me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,326,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,327,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,328,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,329,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,330,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,331,0)="   {""id"": ""q8057"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,332,0)="    ""text"": ""43. Nothing much that happens seems to make me either sad or happy."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,333,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,334,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,335,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,336,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,337,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,338,0)="   {""id"": ""q8058"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,339,0)="    ""text"": ""44. I keep having strange thoughts that I wish I could get rid of."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,340,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,341,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,342,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,343,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,344,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,345,0)="   {""id"": ""q8059"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,346,0)="    ""text"": ""45. I have a great deal of trouble trying to control an impulse to drink in"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,347,0)=" excess."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,348,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,349,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,350,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,351,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,352,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,353,0)="   {""id"": ""q8060"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,354,0)="    ""text"": ""46. I make friends much more easily than most people I know."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,355,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,356,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,357,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,358,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,359,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,360,0)="   {""id"": ""q8061"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,361,0)="    ""text"": ""47. I'm ashamed of some of the abuses I suffered when I was young."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,362,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,363,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,364,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,365,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,366,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,367,0)="   {""id"": ""q8062"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,368,0)="    ""text"": ""48. I think highly of rules because they are a good guide to follow."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,369,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,370,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,371,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,372,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,373,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,374,0)="   {""id"": ""q8063"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,375,0)="    ""text"": ""49. I was on the front cover of several magazines last year."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,376,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,377,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,378,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,379,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,380,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,381,0)="   {""id"": ""q8064"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,382,0)="    ""text"": ""50. I often get angry with people who do things slowly."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,383,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,384,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,385,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,386,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,387,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,388,0)="   {""id"": ""q8065"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,389,0)="    ""text"": ""51. I spend my life worrying over one thing or another."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,390,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,391,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,392,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,393,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,394,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,395,0)="   {""id"": ""q8066"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,396,0)="    ""text"": ""52. I always wonder what the real reason is when someone is acting especially"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,397,0)=" nice to me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,398,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,399,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,400,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,401,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,402,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,403,0)="   {""id"": ""q8067"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,404,0)="    ""text"": ""53. I'm animated and inspired by my daily activities."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,405,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,406,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,407,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,408,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,409,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,410,0)="   {""id"": ""q8068"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,411,0)="    ""text"": ""54. I have many ideas that are ahead of the times."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,412,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,413,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,414,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,415,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,416,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,417,0)="   {""id"": ""q8069"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,418,0)="    ""text"": ""55. I can no longer concentrate on anything since I experienced serious"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,419,0)=" concussions."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,420,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,421,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,422,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,423,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,424,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,425,0)="   {""id"": ""q8070"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,426,0)="    ""text"": ""56. People have said in the past that I became too interested and too excited"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,427,0)=" about too many things."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,428,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,429,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,430,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,431,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,432,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,433,0)="   {""id"": ""q8071"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,434,0)="    ""text"": ""57. I have completely lost my appetite and have trouble sleeping most nights.    "", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,435,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,436,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,437,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,438,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,439,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,440,0)="   {""id"": ""q8072"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,441,0)="    ""text"": ""58. Ever since I was a child, I have been losing touch with the real world."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,442,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,443,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,444,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,445,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,446,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,447,0)="   {""id"": ""q8073"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,448,0)="    ""text"": ""59. I can't experience much pleasure because I don't feel I deserve it."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,449,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,450,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,451,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,452,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,453,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,454,0)="   {""id"": ""q8074"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,455,0)="    ""text"": ""60. I prefer being told what to do rather than having to decide for myself."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,456,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,457,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,458,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,459,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,460,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,461,0)="   {""id"": ""q8075"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,462,0)="    ""text"": ""61. My use of so-called \u0022illegal\u0022 drugs has led to family arguments."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,463,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,464,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,465,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,466,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,467,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,468,0)="   {""id"": ""q8076"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,469,0)="    ""text"": ""62. The memory of a very upsetting experience in my past keeps coming back to"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,470,0)=" haunt my thoughts."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,471,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,472,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,473,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,474,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,475,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,476,0)="   {""id"": ""q8077"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,477,0)="    ""text"": ""63. I'm considered by most to be a prudent and careful person."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,478,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,479,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,480,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,481,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,482,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,483,0)="   {""id"": ""q8078"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,484,0)="    ""text"": ""64. I seem to have lost interest in most things that I used to find pleasurable,"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,485,0)=" such as sex."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,486,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,487,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,488,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,489,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,490,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,491,0)="   {""id"": ""q8079"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,492,0)="    ""text"": ""65. I've gotten into trouble with the law a couple of times."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,493,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,494,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,495,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,496,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,497,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,498,0)="   {""id"": ""q8080"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,499,0)="    ""text"": ""66. I have had to be really rough with some people to keep them in line."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,500,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,501,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,502,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,503,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,504,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,505,0)="   {""id"": ""q8081"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,506,0)="    ""text"": ""67. I am very confident."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,507,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,508,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,509,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,510,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,511,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,512,0)="   {""id"": ""q8082"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,513,0)="    ""text"": ""68. People are trying to make me believe that I'm crazy."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,514,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,515,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,516,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,517,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,518,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,519,0)="   {""id"": ""q8083"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,520,0)="    ""text"": ""69. I go on eating binges a couple of times a week."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,521,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,522,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,523,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,524,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,525,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,526,0)="   {""id"": ""q8084"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,527,0)="    ""text"": ""70. I frequently feel there's nothing inside me, like I'm empty and hollow."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,528,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,529,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,530,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,531,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,532,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,533,0)="   {""id"": ""q8085"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,534,0)="    ""text"": ""71. I've always had a hard time stopping myself from feeling blue and unhappy."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,535,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,536,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,537,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,538,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,539,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,540,0)="   {""id"": ""q8086"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,541,0)="    ""text"": ""72. When I'm alone and away from home, I often begin to feel tense and panicky."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,542,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,543,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,544,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,545,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,546,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,547,0)="   {""id"": ""q8087"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,548,0)="    ""text"": ""73. People tell me that I'm a very proper and moral person."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,549,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,550,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,551,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,552,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,553,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,554,0)="   {""id"": ""q8088"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,555,0)="    ""text"": ""74. I have difficulty controlling my anger."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,556,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,557,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,558,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,559,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,560,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,561,0)="   {""id"": ""q8089"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,562,0)="    ""text"": ""75. I'm a very optimistic person."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,563,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,564,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,565,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,566,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,567,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,568,0)="   {""id"": ""q8090"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,569,0)="    ""text"": ""76. Years later, I still have nightmares about an event that was a real threat to"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,570,0)=" my life."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,571,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,572,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,573,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,574,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,575,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,576,0)="   {""id"": ""q8091"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,577,0)="    ""text"": ""77. I seem to need a lot of advice to get things done."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,578,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,579,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,580,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,581,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,582,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,583,0)="   {""id"": ""q8092"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,584,0)="    ""text"": ""78. I have given serious thought recently to doing away with myself."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,585,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,586,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,587,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,588,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,589,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,590,0)="   {""id"": ""q8093"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,591,0)="    ""text"": ""79. Sneaky people try to get credit for things I've done or thought of."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,592,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,593,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,594,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,595,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,596,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,597,0)="   {""id"": ""q8094"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,598,0)="    ""text"": ""80. Lately, I've gone all to pieces."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,599,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,600,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,601,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,602,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,603,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,604,0)="   {""id"": ""q8095"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,605,0)="    ""text"": ""81. Taking so-called \u0022illegal\u0022 drugs may be unwise, but in the past"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,606,0)=" I've found I needed them."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,607,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,608,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,609,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,610,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,611,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,612,0)="   {""id"": ""q8096"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,613,0)="    ""text"": ""82. I'm a very erratic person, changing my mind and feelings all the time."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,614,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,615,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,616,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,617,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,618,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,619,0)="   {""id"": ""q8097"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,620,0)="    ""text"": ""83. I'm very good at making up excuses when I get into trouble."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,621,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,622,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,623,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,624,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,625,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,626,0)="   {""id"": ""q8098"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,627,0)="    ""text"": ""84. I never sit on the sidelines when I'm at a party."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,628,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,629,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,630,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,631,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,632,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,633,0)="   {""id"": ""q8099"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,634,0)="    ""text"": ""85. I seem to make a mess of good opportunities that come my way."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,635,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,636,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,637,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,638,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,639,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,640,0)="   {""id"": ""q8100"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,641,0)="    ""text"": ""86. I sometimes force myself to vomit after eating."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,642,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,643,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,644,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,645,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,646,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,647,0)="   {""id"": ""q8101"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,648,0)="    ""text"": ""87. I'm a special person, so I don't care what others think."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,649,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,650,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,651,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,652,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,653,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,654,0)="   {""id"": ""q8102"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,655,0)="    ""text"": ""88. I watch my family closely so I'll know who can and who can't be trusted."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,656,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,657,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,658,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,659,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,660,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,661,0)="   {""id"": ""q8103"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,662,0)="    ""text"": ""89. There are certain thoughts that keep coming back again and again in my mind."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,663,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,664,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,665,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,666,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,667,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,668,0)="   {""id"": ""q8104"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,669,0)="    ""text"": ""90. Few things in life give me pleasure."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,670,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,671,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,672,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,673,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,674,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,675,0)="   {""id"": ""q8105"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,676,0)="    ""text"": ""91. I feel shaky and have difficulty falling asleep because painful memories of a"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,677,0)=" past event keep running through my mind."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,678,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,679,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,680,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,681,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,682,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,683,0)="   {""id"": ""q8106"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,684,0)="    ""text"": ""92. I often get lost in my thoughts and forget what's going on around me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,685,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,686,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,687,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,688,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,689,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,690,0)="   {""id"": ""q8107"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,691,0)="    ""text"": ""93. I've never been able to shake the feeling that I'm worthless to others."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,692,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,693,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,694,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,695,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,696,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,697,0)="   {""id"": ""q8108"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,698,0)="    ""text"": ""94. I have a drinking problem that I've tried unsuccessfully to end."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,699,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,700,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,701,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,702,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,703,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,704,0)="   {""id"": ""q8109"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,705,0)="    ""text"": ""95. Someone has been trying to control my mind."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,706,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,707,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,708,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
