^YTT(601.712,115,1,1136,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1137,0)="   {""id"": ""q8169"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1138,0)="    ""text"": ""155. I've become enthusiastic about almost anything I do."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1139,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1140,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1141,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1142,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1143,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1144,0)="   {""id"": ""q8170"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1145,0)="    ""text"": ""156. I am confused about who I am."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1146,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1147,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1148,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1149,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1150,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1151,0)="   {""id"": ""q8171"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1152,0)="    ""text"": ""157. I hate to think about some of the ways I was abused as a child."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1153,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1154,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1155,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1156,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1157,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1158,0)="   {""id"": ""q8172"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1159,0)="    ""text"": ""158. I would never break the law, even if I could get away with it."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1160,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1161,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1162,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1163,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1164,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1165,0)="   {""id"": ""q8173"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1166,0)="    ""text"": ""159. There are members of my family who say I'm selfish and think only of myself."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1167,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1168,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1169,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1170,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1171,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1172,0)="   {""id"": ""q8174"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1173,0)="    ""text"": ""160. I flew across the Atlantic 30 times last year."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1174,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1175,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1176,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1177,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1178,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1179,0)="   {""id"": ""q8175"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1180,0)="    ""text"": ""161. Drinking alcohol helps when I'm feeling down."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1181,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1182,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1183,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1184,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1185,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1186,0)="   {""id"": ""q8176"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1187,0)="    ""text"": ""162. I would much rather follow someone than be the leader."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1188,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1189,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1190,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1191,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1192,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1193,0)="   {""id"": ""q8177"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1194,0)="    ""text"": ""163. Ideas often race through my mind much faster than I can speak them."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1195,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1196,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1197,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1198,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1199,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1200,0)="   {""id"": ""q8178"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1201,0)="    ""text"": ""164. I often get so upset that I want to hurt myself seriously. "", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1202,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1203,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1204,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1205,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1206,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1207,0)="   {""id"": ""q8179"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1208,0)="    ""text"": ""165. Some people say I'm a strange or odd person."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1209,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1210,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1211,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1212,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1213,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1214,0)="   {""id"": ""q8180"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1215,0)="    ""text"": ""166. Sometimes I find comfort in my misery."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1216,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1217,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1218,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1219,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1220,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1221,0)="   {""id"": ""q8181"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1222,0)="    ""text"": ""167. I often find that I've been treated unfairly."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1223,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1224,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1225,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1226,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1227,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1228,0)="   {""id"": ""q8182"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1229,0)="    ""text"": ""168. I quickly show my anger at people who disagree with me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1230,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1231,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1232,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1233,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1234,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1235,0)="   {""id"": ""q8183"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1236,0)="    ""text"": ""169. I feel guilty much of the time and often don't know why."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1237,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1238,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1239,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1240,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1241,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1242,0)="   {""id"": ""q8184"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1243,0)="    ""text"": ""170. I've been feeling sad and blue and can't seem to snap out of it."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1244,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1245,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1246,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1247,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1248,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1249,0)="   {""id"": ""q8185"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1250,0)="    ""text"": ""171. I know how to charm people."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1251,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1252,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1253,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1254,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1255,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1256,0)="   {""id"": ""q8186"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1257,0)="    ""text"": ""172. I have always had to watch out for people who are trying to cheat me."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1258,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1259,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1260,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1261,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1262,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1263,0)="   {""id"": ""q8187"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1264,0)="    ""text"": ""173. I'm always willing to go along with what others would like to do."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1265,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1266,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1267,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1268,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1269,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1270,0)="   {""id"": ""q8188"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1271,0)="    ""text"": ""174. I approach all of life's challenges with a bold and vigorous attitude."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1272,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1273,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1274,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1275,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1276,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1277,0)="   {""id"": ""q8189"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1278,0)="    ""text"": ""175. I never feel like I have anything worthwhile to contribute to a"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1279,0)=" conversation."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1280,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1281,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1282,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1283,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1284,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1285,0)="   {""id"": ""q8190"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1286,0)="    ""text"": ""176. If a medication is not helping me, I may take it more frequently or increase"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1287,0)=" the dose."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1288,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1289,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1290,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1291,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1292,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1293,0)="   {""id"": ""q8191"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1294,0)="    ""text"": ""177. I've had many periods in my life when I was so cheerful and used up so much"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1295,0)=" energy that I fell into a low mood."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1296,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1297,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1298,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1299,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1300,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1301,0)="   {""id"": ""q8192"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1302,0)="    ""text"": ""178. I often feel very unhappy with who I am."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1303,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1304,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1305,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1306,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1307,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1308,0)="   {""id"": ""q8193"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1309,0)="    ""text"": ""179. I don't like to change my routine."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1310,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1311,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1312,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1313,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1314,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1315,0)="   {""id"": ""q8194"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1316,0)="    ""text"": ""180. I don't need to have close friendships like other people do."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1317,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1318,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1319,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1320,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1321,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1322,0)="   {""id"": ""q8195"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1323,0)="    ""text"": ""181. Physically hurting myself has sometimes brought me comfort."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1324,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1325,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1326,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1327,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1328,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1329,0)="   {""id"": ""q8196"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1330,0)="    ""text"": ""182. Many people have been spying into my private life for years."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1331,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1332,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1333,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1334,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1335,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1336,0)="   {""id"": ""q8197"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1337,0)="    ""text"": ""183. I'm pretty good at deceiving people when I want to."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1338,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1339,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1340,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1341,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1342,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1343,0)="   {""id"": ""q8198"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1344,0)="    ""text"": ""184. Even in good times, I've always been afraid things would soon go bad."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1345,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1346,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1347,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1348,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1349,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1350,0)="   {""id"": ""q8199"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1351,0)="    ""text"": ""185. I am very good at inspiring and energizing others."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1352,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1353,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1354,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1355,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1356,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1357,0)="   {""id"": ""q8200"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1358,0)="    ""text"": ""186. I'm willing to starve myself to be even thinner than I am."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1359,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1360,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1361,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1362,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1363,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1364,0)="   {""id"": ""q8201"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1365,0)="    ""text"": ""187. I am often irritable and short-tempered."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1366,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1367,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1368,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1369,0)="     {""id"": ""c3920"", ""text"": ""2. False"", ""quickKey"": 2}"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1370,0)="   ]}, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1371,0)="   {""id"": ""q8202"", ""type"": ""ChoiceQuestion"", ""required"": false, ""inline"": false, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1372,0)="    ""text"": ""188. I always try to finish my work before taking time out for leisure"
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1373,0)=" activities."", "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1374,0)="    ""columns"": 1, "
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1375,0)="    ""choices"":["
^YTT(601.712,115,1,1376,0)="     {""id"": ""c3919"", ""text"": ""1. True"", ""quickKey"": 1}, "
