^YTT(601.712,132,1,55,0)="    ""text"": ""<strong>Where You Are and Where You Would Like to Be</strong><br /><br />"
^YTT(601.712,132,1,56,0)="For each area below, consider &ldquo;Where you are&rdquo; and &ldquo;Where you want to be&rdquo;. "
^YTT(601.712,132,1,57,0)="<br />Select a number between 1 (low) and 5 (high) "
^YTT(601.712,132,1,58,0)=" that best represents where you are and where you want to be. You do not need to be a 5 in any of the areas now, "
^YTT(601.712,132,1,59,0)=" nor even wish to be a 5 in the future. "
^YTT(601.712,132,1,60,0)="<br /><br />"
