^YTT(601.712,154,1,10,0)=" see if you are suffering from side effects from your antipsychotic medication."
^YTT(601.712,154,1,11,0)=" <br />Please select the choice which best indicates the degree to which you have"
^YTT(601.712,154,1,12,0)=" experienced the following side effects. Also when you have had a side effect,"
^YTT(601.712,154,1,13,0)=" please select from 1-10 to show how distressing that was for you. <br /><br"
^YTT(601.712,154,1,14,0)=" /><strong>Over the past <u>week</u>:</strong>"""
