^YTT(601.712,156,1,1,0)=" "
^YTT(601.712,156,1,2,0)="{""name"": ""MIDAS"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,3,0)=" ""copyright"": ""Innovative Medical Research 1997 and 2007, AstraZeneca Pharmaceuticals, LP. All Rights reserved."","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,4,0)=" ""restartDays"": 2,"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,5,0)=" ""printTitle"": ""Migraine Disability Assessment Test"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,6,0)=" ""content"":["
^YTT(601.712,156,1,7,0)="   {""id"": ""i2488"", ""type"": ""IntroText"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,8,0)="    ""text"": ""The <strong>MIDAS</strong> (Migraine Disability Assessment) questionnaire was put together to help"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,9,0)=" you measure the impact your headaches have on your life. The information on this"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,10,0)=" questionnaire is also helpful for your primary care provider to determine the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,11,0)=" level of pain and disability caused by your headaches and to find the best"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,12,0)=" treatment for you. <br /><br /><strong>INSTRUCTIONS</strong> <br /><br />Please answer the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,13,0)=" following questions about ALL of the headaches you have had over the last 3"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,14,0)=" months. Enter your answer in the box beneath each question. Enter zero if you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,15,0)=" did not have the activity in the last 3 months."""
^YTT(601.712,156,1,16,0)="    },"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,17,0)="   {""id"": ""q8947"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": true,"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,18,0)="    ""text"": ""1. On how many days in the last 3 months did you miss work or school because of"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,19,0)=" your headaches?"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,20,0)="    ""intro"": ""The <strong>MIDAS</strong> (Migraine Disability Assessment) questionnaire was put together to help"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,21,0)=" you measure the impact your headaches have on your life. The information on this"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,22,0)=" questionnaire is also helpful for your primary care provider to determine the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,23,0)=" level of pain and disability caused by your headaches and to find the best"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,24,0)=" treatment for you. <br /><br /><strong>INSTRUCTIONS</strong> <br /><br />Please answer the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,25,0)=" following questions about ALL of the headaches you have had over the last 3"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,26,0)=" months. Enter your answer in the box beneath each question. Enter zero if you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,27,0)=" did not have the activity in the last 3 months."","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,28,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 70, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 92},"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,29,0)="   {""id"": ""q8948"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": true,"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,30,0)="    ""text"": ""2. How many days in the last 3 months was your productivity at work or school"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,31,0)=" reduced by half or more because of your headaches? (Do not include days you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,32,0)=" counted in question 1 where you missed work or school.)"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,33,0)="    ""intro"": ""The <strong>MIDAS</strong> (Migraine Disability Assessment) questionnaire was put together to help"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,34,0)=" you measure the impact your headaches have on your life. The information on this"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,35,0)=" questionnaire is also helpful for your primary care provider to determine the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,36,0)=" level of pain and disability caused by your headaches and to find the best"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,37,0)=" treatment for you. <br /><br /><strong>INSTRUCTIONS</strong> <br /><br />Please answer the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,38,0)=" following questions about ALL of the headaches you have had over the last 3"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,39,0)=" months. Enter your answer in the box beneath each question. Enter zero if you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,40,0)=" did not have the activity in the last 3 months."","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,41,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 70, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 92},"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,42,0)="   {""id"": ""q8949"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": true,"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,43,0)="    ""text"": ""3. On how many days in the last 3 months did you not do household work (such as"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,44,0)=" housework, home repairs and maintenance, shopping, caring for children and"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,45,0)=" relatives) because of your headaches?"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,46,0)="    ""intro"": ""The <strong>MIDAS</strong> (Migraine Disability Assessment) questionnaire was put together to help"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,47,0)=" you measure the impact your headaches have on your life. The information on this"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,48,0)=" questionnaire is also helpful for your primary care provider to determine the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,49,0)=" level of pain and disability caused by your headaches and to find the best"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,50,0)=" treatment for you. <br /><br /><strong>INSTRUCTIONS</strong> <br /><br />Please answer the"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,51,0)=" following questions about ALL of the headaches you have had over the last 3"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,52,0)=" months. Enter your answer in the box beneath each question. Enter zero if you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,53,0)=" did not have the activity in the last 3 months."","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,54,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 70, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 92},"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,55,0)="   {""id"": ""q8950"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": true,"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,56,0)="    ""text"": ""4. How many days in the last 3 months was your productivity in household work"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,57,0)=" reduced by half of more because of your headaches? (Do not include days you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,58,0)=" counted in question 3 where you did not do household work.)"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,59,0)="    ""intro"": ""The <strong>MIDAS</strong> (Migraine Disability Assessment) questionnaire was put together to help"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,60,0)=" you measure the impact your headaches have on your life. The information on this"
