^YTT(601.712,156,1,65,0)=" months. Enter your answer in the box beneath each question. Enter zero if you"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,66,0)=" did not have the activity in the last 3 months."","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,67,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 70, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 92},"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,68,0)="   {""id"": ""q8951"", ""type"": ""IntegerQuestion"", ""required"": true,"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,69,0)="    ""text"": ""5. On how many days in the last 3 months did you miss family, social or leisure"
^YTT(601.712,156,1,70,0)=" activities because of your headaches?"","
^YTT(601.712,156,1,71,0)="    ""intro"": ""The <strong>MIDAS</strong> (Migraine Disability Assessment) questionnaire was put together to help"
