^YTT(601.712,169,1,112,0)="    ""intro"": ""7. In the past 30 days, how many days did you use any of the following drugs:  "", "
^YTT(601.712,169,1,113,0)="    ""controlWidth"": 60, ""min"": 0, ""max"": 30}, "
