^YTT(601.712,188,1,5,0)="   {""id"": ""i2566"", ""type"": ""IntroText"", "
^YTT(601.712,188,1,6,0)="    ""text"": ""Here are a number of events that people sometimes experience in relation to their"
^YTT(601.712,188,1,7,0)=" use of alcohol and other drugs. Read each one carefully and indicate whether"
^YTT(601.712,188,1,8,0)=" this has EVER happened to you (No or Yes). If an item does not apply to you,"
^YTT(601.712,188,1,9,0)=" mark No and skip to the next question. If it has EVER happened to you, indicate"
^YTT(601.712,188,1,10,0)=" how often it has happened to you DURING THE PAST 30 DAYS (Never, Once or a few"
^YTT(601.712,188,1,11,0)=" times, etc.). <br /><br /> I have been unhappy because of my drinking or drug"
^YTT(601.712,188,1,12,0)=" use."""
^YTT(601.712,188,1,13,0)="    }, "
